<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pacific Enterprises.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pacific Enterprises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatWest Securities said analyst Edward Tirello initiated coverage of Pacific Enterprises with a trading buy rating.</p>
<p>-- stock was up 1/4 at 32-7/8.</p>
